  "description": "TANSAF crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C150 H112 N12 O16 S6 Tb4,4(C2 H3 N1). From the CIF bond table, Tb1 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb2 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Tb3 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb4 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.589-3.901 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 97.08-112.29°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C158H124Tb4N16O16S6. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
